See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for each component's actual terms. Some of what
this repository redistributes is under the GPL-3.0, which is not compatible
with an MIT claim over the repository as a whole.

This project is a reimplementation of Black & White (Lionhead Studios, 2001).
Parts of src/ are translated from the behaviour of the original executable,
which is not ours to license; the MIT grant above applies to the expression of
that translation as written here, not to the original game, its code, or its
data. No game assets are included, and running any of this requires your own
copy of the game.
